---
import CouponCode from './CouponCode.astro';
import {catalog} from '../data/selection';const {slug}=Astro.props;const b=catalog.find(x=>x.slug===slug)!;
---
<section class="reference-plan-section"><h2>参考套餐价格与流量</h2>{b.plans.length?<><p>摘取自 <a href={b.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jichangblog.org 对应品牌资料</a>，本站读取于 2026.10.12。金额为第三方参考，当前在售、倍率、退款与续费条件需在付款前核对。</p><div class="plan-actions">{b.coupon&&<CouponCode code={b.coupon} brand={b.name}/>}<a class="button primary" href={b.affiliateUrl} target="_blank" rel="sponsored nofollow noopener noreferrer">前往品牌入口 ↗</a><p>推广链接 · 优惠有效性与适用套餐需在结账时确认。</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>套餐名称</th><th>支付金额</th><th>支付周期</th><th>标称流量</th></tr></thead><tbody>{b.plans.map(p=><tr><td>{p.name}</td><td>¥{p.price} CNY</td><td>{p.period==='month'?'月付':p.period==='year'?'年付总额':'一次支付'}</td><td>{p.trafficText}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p class="muted">{b.note}。年包流量重置不明时不推断每月额度；“不限时”包是总流量，服务期限与持续经营仍需核对。</p></>:<p>{b.note}。{b.sourceUrl&&<a href={b.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看来源中的疑点说明 ↗</a>}</p>}</section>

